3 January 2020 to 30 April 2024 ($T_{\mathrm{oos}} = 1{,}082$ trading days), and the forecasts of every
regular-hours bar from 3 January 2012 to 30 April 2024 (3{,}075 trading days). We compare a benchmark
heterogeneous autoregressive (HAR) predictor set against an augmented predictor set that incorporates exogenous
