  \item \textbf{Random forest} \citep{Breiman2001} forms the equally weighted average of $B$ regression trees $f_b$, each grown independently on a bootstrap sample of the estimation window with a random subset of candidate predictors evaluated at each split:
    \[
      \hat y_{t,i} = \frac1B \sum_{b=1}^{B} f_b(\bm x_{t,i}).
