% Code: master_table_close.py:1168-1183 (q = +-1); rows.py:1020-1025 (sized q); atm_straddle_lib.py:1325-1344.
\item \textbf{Transaction costs.} Executing at the quoted bid or ask rather than the mid-quote imposes a median half-spread cost of 2.9\% of the straddle premium. No additional commissions or exchange fees are deducted.
\end{itemize}

