We investigate whether exogenous predictors improve intraday forecasts of a futures-based (E-mini) proxy for the realized variance of the S\&P 500
over the closing half-hour interval (15:30--16:00 ET).
% 2026-10-22 (user): parked -- the pooled models are estimated on the 13 regular-hours bars (E34). Was: "Specifically, we estimate each model across all half-hour intervals and evaluate the forecast issued at 15:30 for the closing half hour over the out-of-sample period from"
